{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mumu's Soup Adventure SAMSARA is a puzzle story adventure game where you play as a cute ghost cat and explore various settings such as a forest, a school and a mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/7264ff98814824837c2508f1c75e0a34.poster.avif?t=1752887372\" width=300 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/7264ff98814824837c2508f1c75e0a34.webm?t=1752887372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/7264ff98814824837c2508f1c75e0a34.mp4?t=1752887372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles by using items you've found, or observing hints while exploring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/56fac96dd202b3bbcb0a805568f3e16f.poster.avif?t=1752887372\" width=300 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/56fac96dd202b3bbcb0a805568f3e16f.webm?t=1752887372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/56fac96dd202b3bbcb0a805568f3e16f.mp4?t=1752887372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A different story in each chapter that focuses on the character you've encountered. The stories also contains elements of drama and josei themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/9194d936a6f9b3f3d0af23763c164e93.poster.avif?t=1752887372\" width=300 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/9194d936a6f9b3f3d0af23763c164e93.webm?t=1752887372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/9194d936a6f9b3f3d0af23763c164e93.mp4?t=1752887372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn CG art and world set in a town that mixes modern life with cute fantasy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/e59bc2807bb6b5765e74452843ddd8f2.poster.avif?t=1752887372\" width=300 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/e59bc2807bb6b5765e74452843ddd8f2.webm?t=1752887372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/e59bc2807bb6b5765e74452843ddd8f2.mp4?t=1752887372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The scent of flowers...it calms me.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/8d754d3e330e0d7407cd34e927f31407.avif?t=1752887372\" width=149 height=173 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mumu is a ghost cat, whose master is Jill, the candy witch with a wicked sweet tooth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day,\u00a0Jill decided she wants to make soup, and one of the ingredients is Mumu's heart!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running away from the persistent witch, he also encounters a\u00a0mysterious (and sexy) flower witch, and thus a new duty has begun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Become the overseer of lost souls&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/20529304c41c87c522a76ae41c6471cf.webp?t=1752887372\" width=668 height=25 /></span><strong><i>Observe with Mumu the stories of various lives...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/bda752095f8fdef0fbece515e7cf37d5.avif?t=1752887372\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Angelo's story: </strong>A listless child wanders in a\u00a0mysterious forest to search for his mother.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/587afba9ea60bdb2c22091e672204e22.avif?t=1752887372\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varinna's story: </strong>As a final memory before graduation, A curious student\u00a0wishes to see\u00a0the rumoured ghost at the school's rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/b2fec5c392b65802bf6f7e15dc5a8934.avif?t=1752887372\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silvia's story:\u00a0</strong> Alone in her mansion, the past lingers the widow's\u00a0mind, slowly consuming her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827640/extras/20529304c41c87c522a76ae41c6471cf.webp?t